abstract: >-
  Companion repository for AI Memory: Building an LLM brain, containing book
  sources, lab harnesses, benchmark reports and build tooling. Original code
  is MIT licensed and original book text and artwork are CC BY 4.0; third-party
  material retains its own terms as described in NOTICE.
